[34.477, "o", " __   __         ___\r\n \\ \\ / /_ _ ___ / __| ___ ___\r\n  \\ V / _` |_ /\\__ \\/ -_|_-<\r\n   |_|\\__,_/__||___/\\___/__/\r\n\r\n YazSes 2.15.1 \u2014 Local, offline voice dictation \u2014 hold a key, speak, release.\r\n\r\nAuthor:   Mohsen Seyedkazemi Ardebili <mohsen.seyedkazemi@gmail.com>\r\nWebsite:  https://mskazemi.com/yazses/\r\nSource:   https://github.com/MSKazemi/yazses\r\nIssues:   https://github.com/MSKazemi/yazses/issues\r\nFeatures: https://github.com/MSKazemi/yazses/issues/new\r\n\r\nFound a bug or want a new feature? Open an issue at the Issues link above, or email mohsen.seyedkazemi@gmail.com.\r\n"]
