[37.6, "o", "\u001b[1mWelcome to YazSes \u2014 offline, hold-to-talk voice dictation.\r\n\u001b[0m\r\nEverything runs on your machine. No cloud, no account, nothing leaves your computer.\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m  1. Check prerequisites\u001b[0m\r\n     Run:  yazses doctor\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m  2. Start YazSes\u001b[0m\r\n     Run:  yazses start\r\n     It loads the speech model once (first run can take 10\u201330s), then waits for your hotkey.\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m  3. Dictate\u001b[0m\r\n     Hold  right_ctrl  , speak, then release. Your words type into the focused window.\r\n     Change the key with:  yazses hotkey set <key>\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mHandy next steps\u001b[0m\r\n  yazses test              type a test phrase (no speaking) to confirm typing works\r\n  yazses mic-level --set   tune the mic to your voice if words get dropped\r\n  yazses features          see everything YazSes can do, and turn things on/off\r\n  yazses doctor            diagnose anything that isn't working\r\n"]
