[40.975, "o", "\r\n"]
[41.225, "o", "YazSes capabilities \u2014 toggle with `yazses features enable/disable <name>`:\r\n\r\n\u250c\u2500 Core dictation  (7/20 on)\r\n\u2502  The hold-to-talk essentials and how speech is captured and turned into text.\r\n\u2502         NAME                             TOGGLE NAME      ADVICE\r\n\u2502  \u25cf ON   Dictation core                   \u2014                core\r\n\u2502  \u25cf ON   Voice commands                   commands         recommended (on by default)\r\n\u2502  \u25cb off  Voice punctuation                voice-punctuation optional\r\n\u2502  \u25cf ON   Mid-Thought Undo                 undo             recommended (on by default)\r\n\u2502  \u25cf ON   Voice-activity overlay           overlay          recommended (on by default)\r\n\u2502  \u25cf ON   System-tray icon                 tray             recommended (on by default)\r\n\u2502  \u25cf ON   Text-target guard                target-guard     recommended (on by default)\r\n\u2502  \u25cf ON   Mic-change guard                 mic-guard        recommended (on by default)\r\n\u2502  \u25cb off  Ghost Ahead                      ghost-ahead      optional\r\n\u2502  \u25cb off  Streaming transcription          streaming        optional\r\n\u2502  \u25cb off  Parakeet STT engine (high accuracy) stt-parakeet     optional\r\n\u2502  \u25cb off  Accessibility Continuum          continuum        optional\r\n\u2502  \u25cb off  Wake-Word Activation             wakeword         planned \u2014 designed, not yet wired\r\n\u2502  \u25cb off  Breath-Paced Dictation           breath           planned \u2014 designed, not yet wired\r\n\u2502  \u25cb off  Whisper-Aware Mode               whispermode      optional\r\n\u2502  \u25cb off  Hesitation-Hold Endpointing      hesitation       planned \u2014 designed, not yet wired\r\n\u2502  \u25cb off  Focus-Class Auto-Profile         focusprofile     planned \u2014 designed, not yet wired\r\n\u2502  \u25cb off  Adaptive Latency Governor        latency          planned \u2014 designed, not yet wired\r\n\u2502  \u25cb off  Hands-Free Auto-Stop             autostop         planned \u2014 designed, not yet wired\r\n\u2502  \u25cb off  Codec Streaming (low latency)    codec            planned \u2014 designed, not yet wired\r\n\u2514\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\r\n\u001b[2m\u2026 trimmed for the demo \u2014 run `yazses features` to see every category\u001b[0m"]
